Comparison of IoT Ideas
Idea	Main Purpose	Difficulty
Bus Tracker	Counts passengers and detects overcrowding	Medium
Smart Bin	Detects when bins are full	Easy–Medium
Library Occupancy	Shows available space in a room	Medium
Why Bus Tracker Was Chosen
The Bus Tracker was chosen because:
•	It solves a clear real-world problem: bus overcrowding.
•	It uses sensors and a Raspberry Pi in a practical way.
•	It has clear users: passengers and bus drivers.
•	It provides good opportunities for user stories and Scrum development.
•	The project is achievable within the semester while still being challenging enough to demonstrate IoT skills.

